{
  "_comment": [
    "Brand-asset manifest. Each entry is a source image somewhere on the open",
    "web plus the file it should become in this repo, at the size and crop the",
    "site actually uses. .github/workflows/brand-assets.yml fetches, converts",
    "and commits them — the conversion happens on a runner because the sources",
    "live on hosts the authoring session cannot reach.",
    "",
    "Re-running is safe: a byte-identical result produces no commit. To swap an",
    "asset, change its `src` and push; to stop managing one, delete its entry",
    "(the committed file stays).",
    "",
    "Sources here are Higgsfield generations (Cinema Studio 2.5 / Nano Banana 2),",
    "prompted from the NULLTAG palette: void #0a0a0a, bone #e8e3da, tiefrot",
    "#ff2a55, one red mark per surface."
  ],
